WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:01.468
A SEMI TRUCK OVERTURNED NEAR
ATLANTA YESTERDAY, AND SPILLED

00:00:01.468 --> 00:00:04.971
40,000 POUNDS OF BROCCOLI ON TO
THE HIGHWAY.

00:00:04.971 --> 00:00:06.840 align:start size:94% position:6%
SAID ONE RESPONDING OFFICER,
FLORET!

00:00:06.840 --> 00:00:12.512
[ AUDIENCE GROANS ]
THIS BRINGS US TO A NEW SEGMENT

00:00:12.512 --> 00:00:15.582 align:start size:94% position:6%
CALLED "ONE OF MY WRITERS
EXPLAINS A JOKE."

00:00:15.582 --> 00:00:20.320
♪♪♪
SO IAN, YOU WANT TO EXPLAIN THAT

00:00:20.320 --> 00:00:23.056 align:start size:94% position:6%
JOKE?
&gt;&gt; YEAH.

00:00:23.056 --> 00:00:26.426
[ LAUGHTER ]
SO YOU KNOW HOW THE LITTLE TREE

00:00:26.426 --> 00:00:29.295 align:start size:94% position:6%
PART OF THE BROCCOLI -- IT'S
CALLED THE FLORET?

00:00:29.295 --> 00:00:32.265 align:start size:94% position:6%
&gt;&gt; Seth: YEAH.
[ LAUGHTER ]

00:00:32.265 --> 00:00:35.902
&gt;&gt; UH -- AND ALSO, IF YOU WANT
TO GO SOMEWHERE FAST IN A CAR --

00:00:35.902 --> 00:00:41.908 align:start size:94% position:6%
[ LAUGHTER ]
YOU MIGHT SAY "FLOOR IT?"

00:00:41.908 --> 00:00:45.045
&gt;&gt; Seth: YEAH.
NOW, OBVIOUSLY, WHEN I READ THAT

00:00:45.045 --> 00:00:48.314
JOKE, I KNEW THAT, BECAUSE YOU,
IN THE PUNCHLINE, SPELLED FLORET

00:00:48.314 --> 00:00:52.052 align:start size:94% position:6%
F-L-O-R-E-T, BUT SINCE THEY
SOUND THE SAME, DID YOU REALLY

00:00:52.052 --> 00:00:54.788
THINK THE ENTIRE AUDIENCE WOULD
JUMP TO THE CONCLUSION THAT YOU

00:00:54.788 --> 00:01:00.794 align:start size:94% position:6%
MEANT THE BROCCOLI FLORET?
[ LAUGHTER ]

00:01:00.794 --> 00:01:08.168
&gt;&gt; WELL IN MY MIND, THE POLICE
OFFICER WANTED TO GET TO THE

00:01:08.168 --> 00:01:12.105 align:start size:94% position:6%
EMERGENCY QUICKLY.
[ LAUGHTER ]

00:01:12.105 --> 00:01:16.376 align:start size:94% position:6%
BUT HE ALSO SAW BROCCOLI.
[ LAUGHTER ]

00:01:16.376 --> 00:01:21.614
AND SO AS A REQUEST, AND ALSO AS
A WARNING --

00:01:21.614 --> 00:01:26.219 align:start size:94% position:6%
[ LAUGHTER ]
HE SAID, "FLORET."

00:01:26.219 --> 00:01:33.093 align:start size:94% position:6%
[ CHEERS AND APPLAUSE ]
&gt;&gt; THIS HAS BEEN, "ONE OF MY

00:01:33.093 --> 00:01:38.264 align:start size:94% position:6%
WRITERS EXPLAINS A JOKE."
&gt;&gt; Seth: YOU GUYS HAVE REALLY

00:01:38.264 --> 00:01:40.800 align:start size:94% position:6%
SET ME BACK BY APPLAUDING FOR
THAT.

00:01:40.800 --> 00:01:42.268 align:start size:94% position:6%
[ LAUGHTER ]

